OL,3,AUK says Brexit reset deal 'done' but
OL,4,Atalks to continue in some areas after
OL,5,AEU tuition fees demand
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is in
OL,8,FBrussels where he's trying to secure a
OL,9,Fnew UK-EU deal, covering issues such as
OL,10,Fyouth mobility, food exports, carbon
OL,11,Femissions and migration
OL,13,FBut EU officials say the deal won't
OL,14,Fhappen unless the prime minister agrees
OL,15,Fto cut university tuition fees for
OL,16,FEuropean students
OL,18,FThe youth mobility scheme is expected
OL,19,Fto allow 100,000 young people from the
OL,20,FEU to travel, work and study in the UK
OL,21,Fper year - the same number of young
OL,22,FBritons would be allowed into Europe
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
