OL,3,ATens of thousands of UK fridges secured
OL,4,Afrom hackers in secret nationwide
OL,5,Aoperation
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was thought the UK had largely
OL,8,Fescaped such hacks as the British
OL,9,Frefrigeration industry relies on
OL,10,Fdifferent devices but there was in fact
OL,11,Fa potential vulnerability the sector
OL,12,Fhas been rushing to fix.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
