OL,3,AMassive hope for pancreatic cancer pill
OL,4,Aafter trial saw tumours vanish
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts are calling it the biggest
OL,7,Fbreakthrough in pancreatic cancer
OL,8,Ftreatment for decades - a daily pill
OL,9,Fthat appears to shrink and possibly
OL,10,Feven eliminate tumours in some patients
OL,11,Fwith one of the deadliest and
OL,12,Fhardest-to-treat cancers.
OL,14,FCancer became undetectable on scans in
OL,15,Fone in 12 of the patients given
OL,16,Fdaraxonrasib along with chemotherapy in
OL,17,Fearly medical trials.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
